{title: Jingle Bell Rock}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Jingle bell, [Gmaj7]jingle bell, [G6]jingle bell [G]rock
[G6]Jingle bells [G]swing and [Am]jingle bells [D7]ring
[Am]Snowin’ and [D7]blowin’ up [Am]bushels of [D7]fun
[D]Now the jingle hop [Am]has be[D7]gun
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Jingle bell, [Gmaj7]jingle bell, [G6]jingle bell [G]rock
[G6]Jingle bells [G]swing and [Am]jingle bells [D7]ring
[Am]Dancin’ and [D7]prancin’ in [Am]Jingle Bell [D7]Square
[Am]In the [D]frosty air [G] [G7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
*What a [C]bright time, it’s the [Cm] right time*
*To [G]rock the night a[G7]way*
*Jingle [A]bell time is a [A7] swell time*
*[D] To go [D7]glidin’ in a [D]one-horse [D7]sleigh*
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Giddy-up, [Gmaj7]jingle horse, [G6]pick up your [G]feet
Jingle around the [E7]clock
[C]Mix and [Cm]mingle in a [A7]jinglin’ [Cm]beat
[Am] That’s the [D7]jingle bell [G]rock!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Jingle [Gmaj7]bell, jingle [G6]bell, [G]jingle bell rock
[G6]Jingle [G]bells chime [Am]in [D7]jingle bell time
[Am]Dancin’ and [D7]prancin’ in [Am]Jingle Bell [D7]Square
[Am]In the [D]frosty air [G] [G7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
*What [C]a bright time, [Cm]it’s the right time*
*To [G]rock the [G7]night away*
*Jingle [A]bell time is a [A7] swell time*
*[D] To go [D7]glidin’ in a [D]one-horse [D7]sleigh*
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: First Ending}
[G]Giddy-up, [Gmaj7]jingle [G6]horse, pick [G]up your feet
Jingle around the [E7]clock
[C]Mix and [Cm]mingle in a [A7]jinglin’ [Cm]beat
[Am] That’s the [D7]jingle bell [G]rock!

{comment: D.C.}

{comment: Second Ending}
[G]Giddy-up, [Gmaj7]jingle horse, [G6]pick up your [G]feet
Jingle around [E7]the clock
[C]Mix and [Cm]mingle in a [A7]jinglin’ [Cm]beat
[Am]That’s the jingle bell, [D7]that’s the jingle bell
[Am]That’s the [D7]jingle bell [G]rock!
